# Plate masters are ~8 MB PNGs and git history is permanent, so they are versioned through
# LFS rather than committed inline (ADR-0008). The manual never serves these: the site
# ships art/web/*.webp, which is ordinary git content at roughly 70 KB a plate.
#
# Requires `git lfs install` once per machine before the first commit that touches them.
art/plates/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
